#: ../../_handwritten/packages/visual_slam.md:1
msgid "Visual SLAM"
msgstr "Visual SLAM"

#: ../../_handwritten/packages/visual_slam.md:3
msgid ""
"Visual SLAM is TriOrb BASE's map building and self-localization engine based"
" on stereo keyframe features. The implementation wraps the open-source "
"[stella_vslam](https://github.com/stella-cv/stella_vslam) library — its "
"internal API is considered implementation detail and is not covered in this "
"reference."
msgstr ""
"Visual SLAM は、ステレオキーフレーム特徴量にもとづく TriOrb BASE の地図生成・自己位置推定エンジンです。オープンソースの "
"[stella_vslam](https://github.com/stella-cv/stella_vslam) "
"を内部で利用していますが、ラッパーの内部 API は実装詳細として扱い、本リファレンスでは公開していません。"

#: ../../_handwritten/packages/visual_slam.md:8
msgid "Role on TriOrb BASE"
msgstr "TriOrb BASE における役割"

#: ../../_handwritten/packages/visual_slam.md
msgid "Responsibility"
msgstr "役割"

#: ../../_handwritten/packages/visual_slam.md
msgid "Description"
msgstr "説明"

#: ../../_handwritten/packages/visual_slam.md
msgid "Map building"
msgstr "地図生成"

#: ../../_handwritten/packages/visual_slam.md
msgid ""
"Builds a 3D keyframe-based map while the robot is driven through the "
"environment"
msgstr "手動走行やリモコン走行中にステレオ特徴量から 3D キーフレーム地図を構築"

#: ../../_handwritten/packages/visual_slam.md
msgid "Self-localization"
msgstr "自己位置推定"

#: ../../_handwritten/packages/visual_slam.md
msgid ""
"Estimates 6-DoF robot pose at runtime by matching stereo features against "
"the stored map"
msgstr "保存済み地図とステレオ特徴量を照合して実行時に 6 自由度のロボット姿勢を推定"

#: ../../_handwritten/packages/visual_slam.md
msgid "Map export"
msgstr "地図エクスポート"

#: ../../_handwritten/packages/visual_slam.md
msgid ""
"Exports the 3D map to a 2D occupancy representation used by downstream "
"navigation"
msgstr "ナビゲーションが利用する 2D 占有格子表現に 3D 地図を変換"

#: ../../_handwritten/packages/visual_slam.md
msgid "Map I/O"
msgstr "地図 I/O"

#: ../../_handwritten/packages/visual_slam.md
msgid "Saves / loads map files to the robot controller and PC"
msgstr "ロボットコントローラや PC との間で地図ファイルの保存・読み込みを実施"

#: ../../_handwritten/packages/visual_slam.md:17
msgid "Interfaces you care about"
msgstr "関連する API"

#: ../../_handwritten/packages/visual_slam.md:19
msgid ""
"Day-to-day interaction is through higher-level APIs, not through Visual SLAM"
" directly:"
msgstr "運用では Visual SLAM を直接操作せず、以下の上位 API 経由で利用します:"

#: ../../_handwritten/packages/visual_slam.md:22
msgid "`triorb_vslam_tf` — publishes VSLAM-derived pose as TF"
msgstr "`triorb_vslam_tf` — VSLAM 由来の姿勢を TF として配信"

#: ../../_handwritten/packages/visual_slam.md:23
msgid "`trirob_vslam_tf_bridge` — bridges VSLAM to navigation pose"
msgstr "`trirob_vslam_tf_bridge` — VSLAM 姿勢をナビゲーション用姿勢へブリッジ"

#: ../../_handwritten/packages/visual_slam.md:24
msgid ""
"`triorb_dead_reckoning` — fuses VSLAM, odometry, and IMU for robust pose"
msgstr "`triorb_dead_reckoning` — VSLAM・オドメトリ・IMU を統合し堅牢な自己位置を推定"

#: ../../_handwritten/packages/visual_slam.md:25
msgid "The WebAPI's map save / load / switch operations"
msgstr "WebAPI の地図保存・読み込み・切替操作"

#: ../../_handwritten/packages/visual_slam.md:27
msgid "See those packages for the public topic / service surface."
msgstr "公開されているトピック / サービスは各パッケージのページを参照してください。"

